      "gaps": [
        "Core now tracks parent and child sessions (attach, stop with the parent, detach on destroy). No macOS handler is installed yet, so adapters that spawn child sessions are still answered with a failure until the workbench can host more than one active session. Go and Node debugging was removed and will return through language plugins."
